      <VERS vnumber="9"> And my <gr str="5315">soul </gr>shall be <gr str="1523">joyful </gr>in the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>: it shall <gr str="7797">rejoice </gr>in his <gr str="3444">salvation</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="10">
        <gr str="3605">All </gr>my <gr str="6106">bones </gr>shall <gr str="559">say</gr>, <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, <gr str="4310">who </gr>
